{"synopsis":"“Tanpa kemenangan, kelangsungan hidup tidak mungkin. ”\n\nDalam mengejar menjadi makhluk tertinggi di antara semua makhluk hidup, ahli bela diri gila, Ma Jinwol, pernah mengubah dunia bela diri menjadi lautan darah. Namun, setelah pertempuran klimaks dengan Lima Master Dunia, ia dimeteraikan. Millenia telah berlalu … dan sekarang, dia terbangun, bukan di Bumi, tetapi di planet asing. Di sini, di GSP, turnamen tempur universal diadakan setiap 100 tahun sekali, dan ia bersiap untuk menghadapi prajurit terkuat sekali lagi.","alternative_title":"Star of Zenith, Star at the Peak, 정점의 별","author":"Siksa Baeksu","artist":"Siksa Baeksu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ch_41","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_40","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_39","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_38","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_37","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_36","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_35","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_34","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_33","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_32","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_31","number":"31","chapter":"3